# Canonical: agent-specs/ → rendered to .claude/skills/ (actively read by Claude Code).
# .agents/skills/ is a legacy third copy — gitignore from 2026-04-17 to simplify canonical governance.
.agents/skills/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

